      "css": ".ds-button-light{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-height:54px;padding:15px 28px;border:0;border-radius:0;background:var(--white,#fff);color:var(--blue,#142d87);font-family:var(--font,\"General Sans\",Arial,sans-serif);font-size:1rem;font-weight:600;line-height:1.5;cursor:pointer;transition:background .18s,transform .18s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1)}.ds-button-light:hover{background:var(--pale,#eef2f8);transform:translateY(-2px)}.ds-button-light:active{transform:translateY(1px)}.ds-button-light:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--orange,#f47a18);outline-offset:5px;}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-button-light{transition:none}}",
      "description": "Ação sólida e foco explícito; CTA comercial varia por modalidade."
    },
    {
      "name": "Campo de contato",
      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "input",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-field\">Seu nome<input placeholder=\"Como podemos chamar você?\" autocomplete=\"name\"></label>",
      "css": ".ds-field{display:block;font-family:var(--font,\"General Sans\",Arial,sans-serif);font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;color:var(--ink,#111b2b)}.ds-field input{display:block;margin-top:8px;box-sizing:border-box;width:100%;min-height:50px;padding:13px 14px;border:1px solid #aebbcf;border-radius:0;background:#fff;color:var(--ink,#111b2b);font-family:var(--font,\"General Sans\",Arial,sans-serif);font-size:1rem;line-height:1.5}.ds-field input::placeholder{color:#4d5c73;opacity:1}.ds-field input:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--orange,#f47a18);outline-offset:5px;}",
      "description": "Campo branco com rótulo persistente; envio é somente demonstrativo."
    },
    {
      "name": "Modelo selecionável",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "model-card",
      "html": "<button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-model\" aria-pressed=\"true\"><strong>Start 160</strong><span>2023/2024</span><small>A partir de</small><b>R$ 255,00 <span>/semana</span></b></button>",
      "css": ".ds-model{background:var(--control,#e4ded3);color:var(--ink,#111b2b);border:2px solid transparent;padding:16px;text-align:left;font-family:var(--font,\"General Sans\",Arial,sans-serif);cursor:pointer;transition:background .2s,border-color .2s,transform .2s}.ds-model[aria-pressed=true]{background:var(--paper,#f8f4ed);border-color:var(--orange,#f47a18)}.ds-model:hover{background:var(--sand,#f1e5d5);transform:translateY(-2px)}.ds-model:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--orange,#f47a18);outline-offset:5px;}.ds-model>strong{display:block;font-size:1rem;line-height:1.3}.ds-model>span,.ds-model>small{display:block;color:var(--warm-quiet,#49433c);font-size:.875rem;margin-top:3px}.ds-model>small{margin-top:10px}.ds-model>b{display:block;font-size:1rem;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;white-space:nowrap}.ds-model>b>span{font-size:.875rem;font-weight:400}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-model{transition:none}}",
      "description": "Trecho textual do controle real; a foto correspondente é fornecida pelo runtime. Entrada considera apenas prazos do mesmo modelo, sem preço inventado."
    },
    {
      "name": "Prazo selecionável",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "term-control",
      "html": "<button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-term\" aria-pressed=\"true\"><span class=\"ds-choice\"><i></i><span><strong>Semestral</strong><small>Mínimo 180 dias · Menor valor por semana</small></span></span><b>R$ 255,00</b></button>",
      "css": ".ds-term{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.5fr 1fr;align-items:center;gap:14px;min-height:92px;padding:16px;background:var(--control,#e4ded3);color:var(--ink,#111b2b);border:2px solid transparent;text-align:left;font-family:var(--font,\"General Sans\",Arial,sans-serif);cursor:pointer}.ds-term[aria-pressed=true]{background:var(--selected,#f0ddbf);border-color:var(--orange,#f47a18)}.ds-term:hover{background:var(--selected,#f0ddbf)}.ds-term:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--orange,#f47a18);outline-offset:5px;}.ds-choice{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}.ds-choice i{display:grid;place-items:center;flex:0 0 24px;width:22px;height:22px;border:1px solid #80715e;border-radius:50%}.ds-term[aria-pressed=true] i{border-color:var(--ink,#111b2b)}.ds-term[aria-pressed=true] i::after{content:\"\";width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--ink,#111b2b)}.ds-term strong{font-size:1.25rem;font-weight:600}.ds-term small{display:block;font-size:.875rem;line-height:1.4;color:var(--warm-quiet,#49433c);margin-top:5px}.ds-term>b{font-size:1.25rem;font-weight:600;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}@media(max-width:600px){.ds-term{min-height:84px;padding:14px 10px;gap:8px}.ds-term strong,.ds-term>b{font-size:1rem}.ds-choice{gap:8px}.ds-choice i{flex-basis:20px}}",
      "description": "Controle semanal com indicador circular e aria-pressed; diária equivalente fica na cotação abaixo."
    },
    {
      "name": "Cotação do plano",
      "kind": "custom",
